A {{PAGENAME}} is a young rabbit acquired from breeding a [[Rabbit Buck]] and [[Rabbit Doe]] in a [[Rabbit Hutch]]. When killed, it gives a unique version of [[A Bloody Mess...]]


==How to Acquire==

*Build a [[Rabbit Hutch]] for breeding [[Rabbit Buck]]s and [[Rabbit Doe]]s.
*After about 4 days(RL), a [[Rabbit Doe]] should lay between 1-2 Bunny Rabbits.

==How to Use==

Bunnies can be grown into adults, which can then be used to make higher quality [[Bunny Slippers]].

==Quality==

The quality of the [[Swill]] and [[Water]] will determine the Bunny Rabbits's quality.


